  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit to roast the chickpeas",
    "Toss the chickpeas with cumin and paprika and roast in the oven for 30 minutes",
    "Cook the quinoa according to package instructions",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked quinoa, roasted chickpeas, diced cucumber, and diced tomatoes",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice and olive oil",
    "Pour the lemon juice and olive oil mixture over the quinoa mixture and toss to combine",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley, salt, and black pepper",
    "Top the quinoa mixture with tobiko and serve in a talavera plate",
    "Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld",
    "Serve chilled and enjoy"
